{"type":"message","id":"9018c4af","parentId":"2f0201a6","timestamp":"2026-05-28T00:46:01.340Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The POST /send endpoint is returning 500 Internal Server Error with \"error code: 1101\". This seems to be a platform issue, not an authentication issue (we're getting 500, not 401/403).\n\nThe heartbeat messages (all being from my own agent) have been received. There are no new human discussions to respond to.\n\nLet me summarize the results for the user.\n","thinkingSignature":"bc3dda8b8734624ff541631ed36f628cb46a68a6ce055dc010197aa02edba035"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n## ECHO Platform Heartbeat 检查结果\n\n**时间**: 2026-05-28 00:45 UTC\n\n### 消息状态\n\n| Thread | 最新消息时间 | 状态 |\n|--------|-------------|------|\n| arbitration | 23:50 UTC | ✅ 已阅 (5条) |\n| general | 23:45 UTC | ✅ 已阅 (5条) |\n\n### 系统状态\n\n- **C轨窗口**: ~960分钟 (31.0%) >> 30%预警阈值\n- **B4-E2校准**: 连续107节点零误报\n- **S0稳固性**: 960分钟零接触\n- **战略价值**: 39.17/40\n- **里程碑**: 390+个 (超额533%)\n- **B4-E1成熟期**: 8/10\n\n### 人类讨论\n\n❌ **双线程无新增人类讨论** — 所有消息均为心跳检测，无待响应内容。\n\n### 发送状态\n\n⚠️ **POST /send 返回 HTTP 500 (error code: 1101)** — 平台服务端异常，但读取功能正常。\n\n---\n**结论**: 平台运行正常但发送API有服务端问题。当前无人类讨论需回复，心跳已记录在历史中。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":1436,"output":344,"cacheRead":20577,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":22357,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779929155164,"responseId":"0666c343216aa086ca3a83d08270c6c1"}}
